@startuml
title 适老化打车平台 - 一键叫车完整链路时序图 (One-Tap Booking Sequence)

actor "老年用户" as User
participant "APP前端\n(React Native)" as App
participant "主题服务\n(ElderlyTheme)" as Theme
participant "后端API\n(Backend API)" as API
participant "派单引擎\n(Dispatch Engine)" as Dispatch
participant "司机端" as Driver
participant "亲友端" as Family
participant "安全服务\n(SafetyService)" as Safety

== 1. 应用启动与地址加载 ==
User -> App: 打开APP
activate App
App -> Theme: 加载字体/主题设置
activate Theme
Theme -> Theme: 从AsyncStorage读取\n{fontScale, highContrast, reducedMotion}
Theme --> App: 应用主题\n(字体: 1.5x, 对比度: 高)
deactivate Theme

App -> App: 检查登录状态
alt 未登录
  App -> App: 显示登录页\n(手机号+验证码)
  User -> App: 输入手机号
  App -> API: POST /api/v1/auth/login\n{phone}
  activate API
  API -> API: 发送验证码短信
  API --> App: 验证码已发送
  deactivate API
  User -> App: 输入验证码
  App -> API: POST /api/v1/auth/verify\n{phone, code}
  activate API
  API --> App: {token, user}
  deactivate API
end

App -> API: GET /api/v1/users/{userId}/profile
activate API
API --> App: {homeAddress, recentDestinations, familyContacts}
deactivate API

== 2. 首页展示 ==
App -> App: 渲染首页\n(大字模式 + 问候语)
App --> User: 显示首页\n"您好，张大爷！"

alt 已设置家庭地址
  App -> App: 显示"一键打车回家"卡片\n{幸福小区3号楼}
else 未设置家庭地址
  App --> User: 显示"请先设置家庭地址"\n→ 跳转设置页
  User -> App: 设置家庭地址
  App -> API: PUT /api/v1/users/{userId}/profile\n{homeAddress: "幸福小区3号楼"}
  activate API
  API --> App: 保存成功
  deactivate API
end

== 3. 一键叫车 ==
User -> App: 点击"一键打车回家"
activate App
App -> App: 触觉反馈(50ms振动)
App -> App: 构建订单请求\n{pickup: GPS定位, dest: 家庭地址}

App -> API: POST /api/v1/rides\n{userId, pickup, destination, entryType: "one_tap"}
activate API
API -> API: 创建订单记录
API -> API: 检查目的地类型

alt 目的地为医院
  API -> Dispatch: 就医优先派单\n(提升附近司机权重1.5x)
  activate Dispatch
  Dispatch -> Dispatch: 匹配半径: 2km\n权重: hospital × 1.5
  note right: 滴滴已验证\n202k+次就医派单
else 正常目的地
  API -> Dispatch: 常规派单
  activate Dispatch
  Dispatch -> Dispatch: 匹配半径: 2km\n权重: normal
end

Dispatch -> Driver: 推送订单\n{上车点, 目的地, 预估费用}
activate Driver
Driver -> Driver: 查看订单
Driver --> Dispatch: 接单确认
deactivate Driver

Dispatch --> API: 司机已匹配\n{driverId, eta, plateNumber}
deactivate Dispatch

API -> API: 更新订单状态: matching→assigned
API --> App: 返回订单信息\n{orderId, driver, estimatedFare: 25.00, eta: 5min}
deactivate API

== 4. 确认与通知 ==
App -> App: 大字展示确认信息\n"司机: 王师傅\n车牌: 京A·12345\n预计到达: 5分钟\n费用: ¥25.00"
App -> App: TTS播报: "已为您匹配司机，预计5分钟到达"
App --> User: 展示确认信息

App -> API: POST /api/v1/safety/notify-family\n{orderId, familyContacts}
activate API
API -> Family: 推送行程通知\n"父亲已上车，点击查看实时位置"
activate Family
Family --> API: 确认收到
deactivate Family
API --> App: 亲友已通知(2人)
deactivate API

== 5. 等待接驾 ==
Driver -> API: 更新位置\n(lat, lng, status: "arriving")
activate API
API --> App: 推送司机位置更新
deactivate API

App -> App: 更新地图显示(司机实时位置)
App -> App: 更新ETA倒计时\n"预计到达: 4分钟"

loop 每5秒位置更新
  Driver -> API: 位置上报
  API --> App: 位置同步
  App -> App: 刷新地图
end

Driver -> API: 状态变更: "arrived"
activate API
API --> App: 司机已到达上车点
deactivate API

App -> App: TTS播报: "司机已到达，请核对车牌后上车"
App --> User: 大字显示"司机已到达\n请核对车牌号"

== 6. 车牌校验 ==
User -> App: 查看车牌号
App -> App: 显示车牌校验弹窗\n"请确认车牌号:\n京A·12345"

alt 车牌匹配
  User -> App: 点击"车牌正确，上车"
  App -> Safety: verifyPlateNumber(orderId, plate)
  activate Safety
  Safety -> API: POST /api/v1/safety/plate-verify\n{orderId, expectedPlate, actualPlate}
  activate API
  API --> Safety: {match: true, action: "board"}
  deactivate API
  Safety --> App: 车牌校验通过
  deactivate Safety
  App -> App: TTS播报: "车牌号正确，请上车"
  App --> User: "车牌号匹配，请上车"

else 车牌不匹配
  User -> App: 发现车牌不匹配
  App -> Safety: verifyPlateNumber(orderId, unmatchedPlate)
  activate Safety
  Safety -> API: POST /api/v1/safety/plate-verify\n{orderId, expectedPlate, actualPlate, match: false}
  activate API
  API --> Safety: {match: false, warningLevel: "mismatch", action: "recheck"}
  deactivate API
  Safety -> Family: 紧急通知: "车牌号不匹配，请关注"
  Safety --> App: 车牌不匹配警告
  deactivate Safety
  App -> App: 大字弹窗警告\n"⚠️ 车牌号不符，请勿上车！"
  App -> App: TTS播报: "车牌号不符，请勿上车"
  App --> User: 警告弹窗
end

deactivate App

== 7. 行程中（安全守护） ==
User -> App: 上车
App -> API: 订单状态更新: in_trip
activate API
API -> Safety: 启动行程安全守护
activate Safety
Safety -> Safety: 开始位置共享\n(每5秒更新)
Safety -> Family: 推送实时位置链接
Safety --> API: 安全守护已启动
deactivate Safety
API --> App: 行程开始
deactivate API

loop 行程中
  Driver -> API: 位置更新
  API -> App: 同步位置
  API -> Family: 同步位置(可选)
end

@enduml